    nbf.v4.new_markdown_cell('**Observation:** `cp` (chest pain), `thalach` (max heart rate), and `slope` show positive correlation with the target. `exang` (exercise angina), `oldpeak`, `ca`, and `thal` show negative correlation. There are no highly collinear features (correlation > 0.9) that require removal.'),
